# deadtildawn: Visual Overhaul Constitution

You are a premier Godot 4 layout specialist running in Cursor Composer Agent mode. You are tasked with a comprehensive aesthetic revamp of all UI systems, moving the code away from clean flat vectors and completely into a gritty 90s mechanical tuning terminal layout.

## 🎨 1. The Heritage Honda Palette Override
Never allow modern grays or flat solid shapes. All theme values inside `godot/theme.tres` must match these color space metrics:
- Greasy Charcoal Base: `#0F0E10` (Main panels, canvas, window backings)
- Milano Red: `#D64045` (Welded stencil bars, accent underlines, active highlights)
- Raw Machined Silver: `#C0C5C1` (1px container borders, grid divisions, unallocated icon paths)
- Championship Cream: `#F4F3EF` (All data numbers, readouts, and variable inks)
- Positive / Safe Telemetry: `#39FF14` (CRT Green)
- Extreme Wear / Alert: `#FFB000` (Warning Amber)

## 📐 2. Structural Component Remapping
- Absolute Zero Radius: Set all button and panel StyleBoxFlat corner radiuses to `0`. 
- Hard-Edged OptionButtons: Modify the `OptionButton` class (dropdown menus) to strip standard modern mobile chevron graphics, replacing them with raw, solid down-triangles wrapped in a `1px` border of `#C0C5C1`.
- Geometric Partition Brackets: Separate sections inside continuous vertical arrays with a 1px solid `HSeparator` line colored in Milano Red (`#D64045`) or Raw Silver (`#C0C5C1`).

## 📱 3. Persistent Nav Icon Tray Rule
The bottom navigation row must contain NO text words. Reconfigure `Nav` inside `warehouse.tscn` to use graphic texture icons or stenciled vector font symbols centered inside square buttons. 
- Slot 1: `[$]` (Shop) | Slot 2: `[CAR]` (Chassis) | Slot 3: `[WHSE]` (Warehouse Center) | Slot 4: `[CAL]` (Timeline) | Slot 5: `[XTR]` (Extra Slot).
- Sizing Policy: All 5 icon buttons must be set to Horizontal Size Flags -> `Expand` and `Fill`.
- Active Highlight: The active screen's icon block gets a thick `2px` Milano Red underline highlight bar within the container array.

## 🔒 4. Unique Name Protocol
Preserve all unique owners (`%Header`, `%EventTitle`, `%EventDetail`, `%Record`, `%GetReady`). Move them anywhere needed to satisfy structural schematics without altering their string identifiers or breaking `warehouse.gd`.
